        'description': 'Judge up to 32 independent evidence packets using named contracts. Defaults to 10 unique calls, 4 workers, and a 30-second deadline. Reuses identical requests within this batch and returns ordered per-item results or errors. Resolves credentials once. No history is uploaded or stored automatically. Use for assessment criteria, evidence screening, and repeated semantic judgments.',
        'inputSchema': {
            'type': 'object', 'additionalProperties': False, 'required': ['items'],
            'properties': {
